# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented here.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to a four-segment monotonic version scheme: `major.minor.patch.micro`.

Recommended early-alpha starting version: `0.1.0.0`. Reserve `1.0.0.0` for the first stable/public release.

Bump types:
- `major` — breaking product/platform change, incompatible API/auth/data contract change, major relaunch, or stable milestone
- `minor` — meaningful feature/capability added, such as a new surface, integration, billing behavior, workflow, or major UX direction
- `patch` — bug fix or behavior correction, such as CORS/auth compatibility, queue bug, UI regression, or broken API behavior
- `micro` — very small shipped change, such as copy tweak, docs-only, cleanup, styling polish, or small non-risky internal adjustment

